  "content": "<h1>Confluence: Otherworld</h1>\n<h2>概述</h2>\n<p><strong>Confluence: Otherworld</strong> 是一款大型模组，旨在以《Minecraft》重现《Terraria》，并在此基础上进行改编与扩展。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Confluence: Otherworld 是一款基于 Minecraft 开发的大型冒险模组。</li>\n<li>它融合了 Terraria 的元素，以丰富游戏内容和玩法。实现了元素的整合</li>\n<li>目前模组包含：<ul>\n<li>方块</li>\n<li>武器</li>\n<li>盔甲</li>\n<li>饰品</li>\n<li>电路</li>\n<li>工具</li>\n<li>Boss</li>\n<li>遗迹</li></ul></li>\n<li>这是一份庞大的新增内容列表，将带来全新的冒险体验。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>核心元素的保留与升级</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>该模组力求保留 Minecraft 和 Terraria 的核心精髓。</li>\n<li>它并非对 Terraria 的简单复刻，所有新增内容都经过适配，以融入 Minecraft 的 3D 元素中，并尽可能平滑地集成到游戏中。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>经典机制的引入</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>模组包含许多经典的 Terraria 机制，例如：<ul>\n<li> shimmer 转化（光棱转化）</li>\n<li>使用各种工作台进行合成</li>\n<li>NPC</li>\n<li>Boss</li>\n<li>以及更多</li></ul></li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n  <p>如前所述，这些机制均已适配以融入 Minecraft。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2>额外功能：秘密种子</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>最显著的功能是“秘密种子”。</li>\n<li>这些种子允许玩家探索独特的世界</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>官方附加组件</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/confluence-music\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Confluence Music</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/confluence-dimension-patch\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Confluence Dimension Patch</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-experience\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Better Experience</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>图片</h2>\n<h3>腐化之地</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1209464/description_eea12300-263d-4397-9598-697e648e3c2a.png\" alt=\"image\"></p>\n<h3>猩红之地</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1209464/description_e30083a6-7106-4084-85e9-74933b80cc6d.png\" alt=\"image\"></p>\n<h3>发光蘑菇</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1209464/description_2292ff92-a130-4e58-bb8b-1bfcc92495bf.png\" alt=\"image\"></p>\n<h3>灰烬森林</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1209464/description_5ec93b2f-b610-41c7-b49c-49e37d99cb98.png\" alt=\"image\"> <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1209464/description_f07b6b56-bbf6-4a55-94e8-73979ff6bec3.png\" alt=\"image\"></p>\n<h3>丛林</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1209464/description_2781e74f-d712-40b1-8c37-fd708a6d1b13.png\" alt=\"image\"></p>\n<h3>蜂后蜂巢</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1209464/description_fe275069-087f-4fb4-b472-ffe08e3d029e.png\" alt=\"image\"></p>\n<h3>奥西亚斯沙漠</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1209464/description_a1ec7642-c4b6-4672-8b54-1c64a9aa0455.png\" alt=\"image\"></p>\n<h3>天空岛</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1209464/description_886e0700-b6c0-4579-a232-b5cb90d00e54.png\" alt=\"image\"> <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1209464/description_b7e483f9-1462-41fd-9c90-1bfa3449ca5c.png\" alt=\"image\"></p>\n<h3>天空村庄</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1209464/description_e44d7a2e-a94d-485b-ba46-98b2f8d10366.png\" alt=\"image\"></p>\n<h3>活体桃花心木</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1209464/description_00631a10-80d0-438a-a1af-fe0006b5ae1a.png\" alt=\"image\"></p>\n<h3>冰刺</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1209464/description_6d39c1f6-cbd6-4399-bbd7-96c57054b343.png\" alt=\"image\"></p>\n<h3>附魔剑神殿</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1209464/description_4d9c184d-6c48-4faa-b26a-7b37592ec388.png\" alt=\"image\"></p>\n<h3>光棱湖</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1209464/description_3709bf19-86a0-4cb0-bb9f-896b833c5a51.png\" alt=\"image\"></p>\n<h3>活树</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1209464/description_0d97bf3a-22b3-412f-89b0-42b2c2521cba.png\" alt=\"image\"></p>\n<h3>装饰性树木</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1209464/description_cf83a834-2b74-452a-9f7a-7c56b0399584.png\" alt=\"image\"></p>\n<h3>地下墓穴</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1209464/description_13b3ce63-6d90-4b9f-be21-7a8700823820.png\" alt=\"image\"></p>",
